201
00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.720
Instead, the scrutiny process demonstrated that many of them remain

202
00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:45.380
unresolved.

203
00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:50.349
The reason these provisions matter to this bill is that by passing this

204
00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:53.680
legislation, Parliament completes New Zealand's domestic

205
00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:57.360
implementation of the agreement and enables it to enter into

206
