228
00:12:14.964 --> 00:12:17.864
the negotiators, officials, or members of Parliament.

229
00:12:18.404 --> 00:12:22.384
They'll fall on New Zealanders, New Zealand exporters, and businesses making

230
00:12:22.644 --> 00:12:24.004
long-term commercial decisions.

231
00:12:25.184 --> 00:12:28.004
Government may say that these provisions are aspirational.

232
00:12:28.064 --> 00:12:31.884
India may take a different view. The agreement itself contemplates remedial

233
00:12:31.944 --> 00:12:35.424
