234
00:12:36.614 --> 00:12:39.984
That uncertainty should be resolved before the legislation is enacted, not

235
00:12:40.104 --> 00:12:40.604
afterwards.

236
00:12:42.664 --> 00:12:46.484
That leads to a broader concern. Government appears to have transferred treaty

237
